==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - guard:
      auth:
        cookie: session
      enabled: "true"
      on_forbidden:
        redirect: /denied
        status: "403"
      on_unauthenticated:
        hx_redirect: /login
        redirect: /login
        status: "401"
      require:
        authenticated: "true"
==== explainer ====
Optional pre-render route guard. When omitted or disabled, current HYPERMEDIA behavior remains unchanged
